Third-party files in this directory, compiled into renox-core and served by
every app (assets.rs) or drawn into its pages.

htmx.min.js
  htmx 2.0.11, by Big Sky Software. Zero-Clause BSD licence.

alpine.min.js, alpine-csp.min.js
  Alpine.js 3.17.4 and its CSP build, by Caleb Porzio and contributors. MIT
  licence.

idiomorph-0.7.3.min.js
  Idiomorph 0.7.3, the DOM morphing the live components use, by Big Sky
  Software. Zero-Clause BSD licence (idiomorph-LICENSE).
  Source: https://registry.npmjs.org/idiomorph/-/idiomorph-0.7.3.tgz
  (package/dist/idiomorph.min.js). Change: none.

cally.js
  Cally 0.9.2, the date picker's calendar, by Nick Williams. MIT licence
  (the file's first line).

fonts/
  Inter 4.1 and Poppins 4.003, Latin subsets. SIL Open Font License 1.1
  (fonts/OFL-Inter.txt, fonts/OFL-Poppins.txt).

The UI kit's icons (src/icons.rs, the `icon(…)` macro of renox/ui.html)
  Lucide's line icons, lucide-static 1.53.0, by Lucide Icons and
  contributors. ISC licence; the icons derived from Feather (Cole Bemis) are
  also under the MIT licence (lucide-LICENSE, both texts).
  Source: https://registry.npmjs.org/lucide-static/-/lucide-static-1.53.0.tgz
  (icons/<name>.svg). Change: only the elements inside each <svg> are kept;
  the kit draws the <svg> itself, with a stroke width of 1.75 instead of 2.
